    "description": {
      "content": "PSD2 Account Information Services. Authenticates a PSU at their bank using either the redirect or decoupled (mobile-app) model, then retrieves bank accounts, balances, holders, and transactions. Also exposes the AIS-backed identity verification endpoint.\n\n\nContact Support:\n Name: Fintecture Support",
